  "contract": "F-5, the bytes of staged.txt and staged.json (app-update task T6.0b; record docs/app-updates.md 4.6, 4.5 \"The commit\", 4.2): what release 1 writes when it stages the committed golden update files. One payload serves both files (record 2.4 `group`): golden.hrupdate carries every member, golden-win32-only.hrupdate lacks the groups posix, darwin and linux whole. What is staged does not depend on the computer's system; which file can be imported does (the apply script of record 4.4: golden-win32-only.hrupdate is UPD-NO-HELPER on macOS and Linux)",
